data: {"id": "c5b39803618344b6-final", "run_id": "c5b39803618344b6", "seq": 1234, "ts_ms": 1789444113527, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v07/workload 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，处于 Pending 阶段且未启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ImagePullBackOff` (Container: app) | 确认容器处于拉取失败的退避状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_message: \"Back-off pulling image \\\"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\\\"\"` | 指出引发拉取失败的具体镜像及 Registry |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending`, `condition.Ready: False` (ContainersNotReady), `restart_count: 0` | 确认 Pod 始终处于初始化阶段，且未产生任何重启事件 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `resource_request.cpu: 5m`, `resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 排除资源配额导致的调度或运行异常 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1` (Reason: ImagePullBackOff) | 独立于 Kubernetes API 确认容器等待状态的客观指标 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase: 1` (Phase: Pending), `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0` | 验证 Pod 长期滞留且无重启行为，佐证非应用侧崩溃 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 状态与 Prometheus 指标完全一致，均指向 `ImagePullBackOff` 和 `Pending`。由于 `restart_count` 为 0 且 Kubelet 持续重试，说明问题发生在镜像拉取阶段（镜像不可用），而非容器启动后的应用崩溃或资源竞争。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nRegistry 返回镜像 tag 不存在 (NotFound) → 容器运行时无法拉取并解压镜像 → Kubelet 持续重试失败并进入 Back-off → Pod 状态维持 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod 引用的容器镜像 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在指定 Registry 中不存在（NotFound）。这导致容器运行时无法获取镜像层，Kubelet 因持续拉取失败而进入指数退避（Back-off）等待，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `Pending` 阶段且无法进入 `Running` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v07/workload: 45.5s (Evidence 37.4s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v07/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.413, "metrics": {"run_id": "c5b39803618344b6", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.42113089561462, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "52%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 100%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73421.13089561462, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 68098.74701499939, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 14483.338117599487, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4945.0950622558